{"id":"H0630","lemma":"אַסְפָּ֑תָא","transliteration":"aspata","sayIt":"as-PA-ta","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Aspatha","meaning":"A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Est.9.7;\nson of: Haman (H2001);\nbrother of: Parshandatha (H6577), Dalphon (H1813), Poratha (H6334), Adalia (H0118), Aridatha (H0743), Parmashta (H6534), Arisai (H0747), Aridai (H0742) and Vaizatha (H2055)\n§ Aspatha = \"the enticed gathered\"\nthe third son of Haman","glosses":["aspatha"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"est-9","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Aspatha"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Esther 9:7","note":"They killed Parshandatha, Dalphon, Aspatha,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0118","lemma":"אֲדַלְיָא","transliteration":"adalya","gloss":"Adalia"},{"id":"H2001","lemma":"הָמָן","transliteration":"haman","gloss":"Haman"},{"id":"H6577","lemma":"פַּרְשַׁנְדָּתָא","transliteration":"parshandata","gloss":"Parshandatha"},{"id":"H1813","lemma":"דַּלְפוֹן","transliteration":"dalphon","gloss":"Dalphon"},{"id":"H6334","lemma":"פּוֹרָתָא","transliteration":"porata","gloss":"Poratha"},{"id":"H0743","lemma":"אֲרִידָ֑תָא","transliteration":"aridata","gloss":"Aridatha"},{"id":"H6534","lemma":"פַּרְמַשְׁתָּא","transliteration":"parmashta","gloss":"Parmashta"},{"id":"H0747","lemma":"אֲרִיסַי","transliteration":"arisay","gloss":"Arisai"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}